       "nl": "One entry is a perfume sold under its own name; flankers and concentrations (EDT, EDP, parfum, intense) are versions of it.",
       "sel": "The 3 perfumes here are the ones a fetched page places in this family: Wikipedia's Perfume page, the Fragrance wheel page, the perfume's own Wikipedia article, or its Fragrantica or Parfumo page (family taken from the first word of the page's family label, launch year matching). All other perfumes are in Alcohol-based perfume. No complete list exists; follows the perfumes of this department whose family a fetched page states.",
